    reflection: "Obedience isn't legalism; it's love. Jesus says if you love Him, you'll obey Him. Not perfectly, but purposefully. Obedience demonstrates trust, proves love, and positions you for blessing. God doesn't command arbitrarily; He commands for your good. His ways lead to life, peace, and joy. Disobedience always costs more than obedience. Today, what is God asking you to obey? Do it. Not out of duty, but out of love. Blessing follows obedience.",
